# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage
/test-results

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.local.example

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# local DB backups — never commit
db-backups/

# Supabase CLI temp files — never commit
supabase/.temp/

# topothesies raw geodata source — do NOT commit (only emitted JSON enters the
# build path, per ADR 0018). geoBoundaries-GRC-ADM3.geojson etc. live here.
scripts/lib/topothesies/source/

# word list source files — do NOT bundle with the app
# words-el.json is committed (pre-normalised canonical list)
# words-el.raw.json is committed (canonical accented source — 22 MB, not imported by the app)
# answers-5.json and words-5.json are committed (Vercel needs them at build time)
src/data/words-en.json
src/data/*.dic

# --- Agent skills (policy changed 2026-07-16) ---
# .claude/skills is now FULLY COMMITTED — every skill in it, vendored or hand-authored.
# The old policy ignored the vendored copies and treated skills-lock.json as the sole
# source of truth; that was written when 42 skills made the diffs noisy. At a curated ~14,
# an upstream change showing up as a reviewable git diff is a feature, not noise — and it
# means a fresh clone has working skills without running `npx skills` at all.
# skills-lock.json is still committed and still drives `npx skills@latest add`.
# See CLAUDE.md "Skill install note" for which skills are forked (out of the lock on purpose).
#
# .agents/skills is the vendor-neutral install location `npx skills` writes to before
# mirroring into .claude/skills. Claude Code never reads it, so it stays ignored — it is
# 100% tool-generated scratch.
.agents/skills/

# --- Logopaignio logo staging (added 2026-07-27) ---
# Raw downloaded logos (fetch-logopaignio-logos.mjs → public/logopaignio/_raw/)
# are staging material: full logos WITH wordmarks, awaiting the mark-only crop.
# Only processed marks in public/logopaignio/ ship. See handoff logopaignio-content-pool.md.
public/logopaignio/_raw/
